From e02b44739c03a7c4cad9d4fb8804ef6b3bb4f45e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zglstudylinux <zglstudylinux@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 09:33:21 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 2/4] t113: zgl_board switch lcd0 to D240N2501V1 (ST7701SN)
 MIPI panel

- board.dts lcd0: st7701sn_d240n2501v1, dclk 28MHz (DSI PHY floor),
  ht 508 / vt 850 (65Hz), 2-lane video mode, PD20 reset, PWM7 backlight;
  fb0 480x640; pwm-backlight node; twi3 stays disabled (UART3)
- touch (dxts@38), rfkill, uart1 present but disabled until phase-3/4/5
- uboot-board.dts: lcd_used=0 with lcd0 timing synced to new panel
  (prevents stale boot_disp geometry injection causing half-screen)
- config-5.4: LCD_SUPPORT_ST7701SN_D240N2501V1 + BACKLIGHT_{CLASS,PWM,GPIO}

Verified on board: boot logo, colorbar/snow/black pass (adb 2026-10-15).
